    "media:imagetext": "xod yoeus\nApPLE SAUCE INGREDIENTS:\nAPPLES, ASCORBIC ACID (TO MAINTAIN COLOR).\nCHOCOLATE CHIP COOKIE INGREDIENTS: DR. LUCY'S FLOUR\nBLEND (GLUTEN-FREE OAT, GARBANZO, POTATO STARCH, TAPIOCA, SORGHUM AND FAVA FLURS), ORGANIC CANE SUGAR\", VEGAN\nCHOCOLATE CHIPS (SUGAR, UNSWEETENED CHOCOLATE, ANHYDROUS DEXTROSE, COCOA BITTER, SOY LECITHIN, NATURAL VANILLA\nEXTRACT), SOY MILK*, MOLASSES*, SUSTAINABLE PALM FRUIT OIL, EXPELLER PRESSED CANCLA OIL, OLIVE OIL, FILTERED WATER, FLAVORING\nAND CITRIC ACID FROM NON-GMO CORN, SUNFLOWER LECITHIN, NON-DAIRY LACTIC ACID, BAKING POWDER, BAKING SODA, POTASSIUM\nBITARTRATE, VANILLA EXTRACT', SALT, XANTHAN GUM, CALCIUM CARBONATE, ANNATTO EXTRACT COLOR, CELLULOSE GUM.\nCHEDDAR\nPUFF INGREDIENTS:\nCORNMEAL, RICE FLOUR, SUNFLOWER OIL AND/OR EXPELLER PRESSED CANOLA OIL, CHEDDAR CHEESE (CULTURED\nMILK, SALT, ENZYMES), WHEY, BUTTERMILK, SALT, SEA SALT, CITRIC ACID, ORGANIC BLACK PEPPER\nTURKEY SNACK INGREDIENTS:\nTURKEY,\nMECHANICALLY SEPARATED TURKEY, SALT, CORN SYRUP SOLIDS, SPICES, DEXTROSE, LACTIC ACID STARTER CULTURE, CARRAGEENAN,\nSODIUM ERYTHORBATE (MADE FROM SUGAR), GARLIC POWDER, SODIUM NITRITE, IN COLLAGEN CASING.\nALLERGENS: COOKIES CONTAIN SOY, OATS AND FAVA. CHEDDAR PUFFS CONTAIN MILK.\nDISTRIBUTED BY OAKFIELD FARMS SOLUTIONS, LLC, GRAPEVINE, TEXAS 76051\nBEST BY 04/11/18",
